abstract: >
PolyMolStudio is an open-source computational framework for polymer
glass-transition temperature design, integrating molecular generation,
machine-learning-based property prediction, candidate screening, and
molecular dynamics validation. The software accompanies the manuscript
entitled "A Multimodal Screening and Validation Framework for Polymer
Glass-Transition Temperature Design".

